WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Narrator: Before the gates open, the team builds the queue.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Narrator: Barriers are linked firmly, so nobody can slip through.

3
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Narrator: Lanes are the same width, and the staff path and the gaps at the turns stay clear.

4
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Narrator: The emergency lane is marked and empty.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Narrator: Each marshal takes a position from the Dot Plan.

6
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.500
Faisal: Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22. Gate 4 queue ready, emergency lane clear. Over.

7
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.500
Narrator: Then Faisal tells the supervisor: queue ready, lane clear.

